### Encrypt an SSN for tenant acme
POST http://localhost:8080/encrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{"context": {"tenantId": "acme", "field": "ssn"}, "plaintext": "123-45-6789"}

> {% client.global.set("ciphertext", response.body.ciphertext); %}

### Decrypt it in the same context
POST http://localhost:8080/decrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{"context": {"tenantId": "acme", "field": "ssn"}, "ciphertext": "{{ciphertext}}"}

### Decrypting under another tenant fails
POST http://localhost:8080/decrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{"context": {"tenantId": "globex", "field": "ssn"}, "ciphertext": "{{ciphertext}}"}

### Re-encrypt under the current primary key
POST http://localhost:8080/reencrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{"context": {"tenantId": "acme", "field": "ssn"}, "ciphertext": "{{ciphertext}}"}

### Fetch the hybrid public key (hybrid profile)
GET http://localhost:8080/hybrid/public-key
